<bioghist encodinganalog="545$a">
<head>Biographical Information
</head>
<p>William Tisinger was born 1 September 1816 in Shenandoah County, Virginia, to John Tisinger (1777-1854) and Elizabeth Catherine Bowman Tisinger (1776-1842).  William Tisinger became surveyor for Shenandoah County.  He married Amelia H. Will (1820-1885) 14 June 1848, and they had six children.
</p>
</bioghist>
<scopecontent encodinganalog="520$a">
<head>Scope and Content
</head>
<p>Surveyor records, 1851-1885, of William Tisinger (1816-1887) of Shenandoah County, Virginia, consisting of survey books, account books, accounts, correspondence, court records, financial records, notes, survey notes, and other papers regarding Tisinger's surveying work.
</p>
</scopecontent>
